  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Once per rest, you can activate your Kinetic Cascade. While active, you gain a Cascade Die. At level 1, your Cascade Die is a <strong>d6</strong>. Place it on your character sheet with the value set to 1. The Cascade is active until the scene ends.</p><ul><li><p>Add the current value of your Cascade Die to your damage rolls.</p></li><li><p>Whenever you take damage, increase the Cascade Die’s value by 1.</p></li><li><p>When the Cascade Die’s value would exceed its maximum, your Kinetic Cascade discharges: All targets within Close range make a Reaction Roll with a Difficulty equal to 10 + your level. Targets who fail take <strong>d10+5</strong> energy damage using your Proficiency and are pushed back to Far range. On a success, they take half damage.</p></li><li><p>After the discharge, reset your Cascade Die’s value to 1.</p></li><li><p>At level 5, your Cascade Die is reduced to a <strong>d4</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
